                "title": "Introducing Muse Spark 1.1"
            }
        ],
        "paragraphs": [
            "Meta Muse is the personal AI agent from Meta. Meta says Muse gets to know you and your goals, working across all aspects of life, and that it can answer questions, complete tasks, browse the web, make purchases, generate images, create documents, and connect with apps and services via Connectors. Meta says Muse is agentic AI: when you give it a task, it figures out which built-in skills it needs and gets to work, and it keeps working in the background after you close the app. It is offered through the Muse app on mobile, Mac, or directly in WhatsApp, and it is available for free with a usage limit, with a paid subscription for more.",
            "The family also includes media generation and reasoning models from Meta Superintelligence Labs. Muse Image and Muse Video are the first media generation models developed by Meta Superintelligence Labs; Muse Image is available across the Meta AI app and on meta.ai, Instagram Stories in the US, and WhatsApp in limited countries, and is coming soon to Facebook, while Muse Video is coming soon to creators and Meta AI. Muse Spark 1.1 is a multimodal reasoning model built for agentic tasks, available in Thinking mode in the Meta AI app and on meta.ai, and for the first time developers can build with it via the new Meta Model API, now in public preview. Meta also offers Muse for Small Business, a collection of new skills and connectors, and Muse for Mac."
        ],
        "written_on": "2026-10-07"
